	(text "Clock has no pullup. Start at low speed; qualify high-speed\noperation after routing. Keep return plane continuous.\nCD pin9 contacts shield on insertion; validate switch behavior.\nUse firmware card detection and unmount before removal.\nmicroSD card is user supplied and not in assembled BOM."
